{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/678c13f480a0d119ed3c530ed5ebf5c0.poster.avif?t=1751900441\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/678c13f480a0d119ed3c530ed5ebf5c0.webm?t=1751900441\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/678c13f480a0d119ed3c530ed5ebf5c0.mp4?t=1751900441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strap on your high-velocity jumping stilts and clock in at <strong>H.O.E. (Hot Organ Express)</strong> - the only delivery service crazy enough to move beating hearts by birdman. Your mission is simple: pick up transplant organs, tear across a soaring sci-fi city, and drop the goods before they flatline. Nail deliveries to earn cash and gain extra time - then crank the difficulty for even wilder runs and bigger payouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play it safe with easy jobs or risk it all on brutal, split-second routes. Either way, momentum is everything: pump your jump charge, ride gravity\u2019s pull, and keep your combo alive by chaining rooftop after rooftop. Crash at full tilt and you\u2019ll rag-doll down to street level - unless you can scramble onto a dumpster boost and vault straight back into the skyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/6430ce2d880bcbbf589376b0b9517f7e.avif?t=1751900441\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jump-only locomotion:</strong> Chain stilt-boosted leaps for breakneck speed and pure, arcade airtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Three route tiers:</strong> Easy, medium, hard. Tougher orders give shorter deadlines but higher rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vertical playground:</strong> Jump from rooftop to rooftop on skyscrapers, through parks, beaches, and even flying cars.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Risk-versus-reward:</strong> Every collision is chaos - master the tilt to stay fluid, or faceplant and lose precious seconds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speed-run ready:</strong> Tight five-minute loops and instant restarts, built for optimization addicts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/ee3e49a1950a0894cf53d2a432e47aa9.poster.avif?t=1751900441\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/ee3e49a1950a0894cf53d2a432e47aa9.webm?t=1751900441\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/ee3e49a1950a0894cf53d2a432e47aa9.mp4?t=1751900441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3777690?t=1751900441","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/2bd4453af4c5a7354962a41ca2af472c726604f8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751900441","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/7e2c92f58562096d3be183a00be502c640966385/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751900441","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/7e2c92f58562096d3be183a00be502c640966385/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751900441","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Came